Wait, first test (borda) — line 87 is `it(...)` line; the error at line 107 — which assertion? The "dentro" at 18:29 → 201? That should pass since fechamento not implemented, always 201... then naBorda at 18:30 → also 201 → assert.equal(naBorda.status, 422) fails. And emAndamento at 20:00 → 201 → fails. So both fail because we always 201. Need R8: check if agora >= início - 30min → INSCRICOES_ENCERRADAS.

Implement in inscrever after cancelada check:
```
const INSCRICOES_FECHAM_ANTES = 30 * 60 * 1000
const inicioPrimeiroEncontro = Date.parse(atividade.encontros[0].inicio)
if (Date.parse(agora()) >= inicioPrimeiroEncontro - INSCRICOES_FECHAM_ANTES) {
  return { erro: 'INSCRICOES_ENCERRADAS' }
}
```
This covers em_andamento/encerrada since their clocks are past fechamento.

